1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,820
Your content is everywhere.

2
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:08,510
Inboxes, drives, old servers, someone's laptop.

3
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:10,710
Four moves change that.

4
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:12,660
The problem:

5
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:15,660
the same file lives in seven places.

6
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:18,260
Move one: bring it all in.

7
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,600
Drop in files, and whole folders.

8
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:21,480
Send a link,

9
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,730
and clients upload without an account.

10
00:00:23,770 --> 00:00:25,570
Capture email from Gmail,

11
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,740
and unpack old PST archives.

12
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:30,620
Move Exchange, Google Drive and SFTP in,

13
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,460
mapped to their owners.

14
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:36,250
Now there's one place, and one set of rules.

15
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:39,270
The problem: finding the right version,

16
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:41,060
and sharing it safely.

17
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:44,800
Move two: find it, share it, finish it.

18
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:46,320
Search across files,

19
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:48,850
scans and email, in seconds.

20
00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:50,530
Preview without downloading,

21
00:00:50,570 --> 00:00:52,910
mark it up, and redact what's private.

22
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:56,190
Share inside and out, with links that expire,

23
00:00:56,230 --> 00:00:58,130
and downloads switched off.

24
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:00,620
Comment, tag, and send for signature,

25
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:02,300
without leaving the page.

26
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:05,340
No more “can you resend it?”

27
00:01:05,380 --> 00:01:06,650
The problem:

28
00:01:06,690 --> 00:01:09,700
rules that live in spreadsheets, and memory.

29
00:01:10,090 --> 00:01:13,280
Move three: let it run by the rules.

30
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:14,880
Workflows route review,

31
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:17,640
approval and signature, on their own.

32
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:20,360
Retention keeps every record on schedule,

33
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,460
and deletes only with approval.

34
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:25,270
Legal hold freezes what a case needs.

35
00:01:25,310 --> 00:01:29,110
Labels, roles and single sign-on decide who can see,

36
00:01:29,150 --> 00:01:30,870
share, or delete.

37
00:01:30,910 --> 00:01:33,110
And every action is on the record,

38
00:01:33,150 --> 00:01:35,140
ready to export.

39
00:01:35,390 --> 00:01:38,910
The problem: content that just sits there.

40
00:01:39,220 --> 00:01:41,370
Move four: put it to work.

41
00:01:41,410 --> 00:01:44,650
Document AI reads scans and fills in the fields,

42
00:01:44,690 --> 00:01:45,870
tables included.

43
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,740
Search by what's inside.

44
00:01:47,970 --> 00:01:49,850
Then ask the Solix AI Assistant.

45
00:01:49,890 --> 00:01:53,850
Summarize a file, ask about a whole folder,

46
00:01:53,890 --> 00:01:56,590
and every answer comes with its sources.

47
00:01:58,250 --> 00:01:59,410
Bring it in.

48
00:01:59,530 --> 00:02:00,620
Find it.

49
00:02:00,670 --> 00:02:01,730
Govern it.

50
00:02:01,780 --> 00:02:03,100
Put it to work.

51
00:02:03,450 --> 00:02:05,410
Solix ECS.

52
00:02:05,450 --> 00:02:10,900
Keep the proof.
